<title>POLAND: Poland to offer PLN 800 mln 2-yr,5-yr bonds Dec 19.</title>
<headline>Poland to offer PLN 800 mln 2-yr,5-yr bonds Dec 19.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poland will hold a joint 800 million zloty auction of 16-percent two-year and 12-percent five year fixed bonds on December 19, the Treasury said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>The two year bonds mature on February 12, 1999 and the payment date for the shorter bonds is January 6, 1997.</p>
<p>The five year bonds are due on February 12, 2002 and the payment date is January 13, 1997.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
